sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor R as Responsable
  participant API as API (contrôleur)
  participant S as SmartAssignService
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant G as Passerelle IA

  R->>API: GET /issues/{id}/smart-assign
  API->>S: recommend(issue)
  S->>DB: candidats (hors congés), compétences, charge, historique
  DB-->>S: métriques par candidat
  S->>S: pré-filtre pondéré, liste courte (5)
  S->>G: scorer la liste courte
  G-->>S: score sémantique + justification
  S->>S: score final pondéré
  S->>DB: journaliser (ai_runs, assignment_events)
  S-->>API: recommandation + alternatives
  API-->>R: candidat, score, justification
